<title>RUSSIA: Tolmachov takes over as Volga-Dnepr chairman.</title>
<headline>Tolmachov takes over as Volga-Dnepr chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viktor Tolmachov, 63, has been appointed chairman of Russia's leading cargo airline Volga-Dnepr, a company spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Tolmachov, who had been technical director since 1991, replaces Nikolai Cherkasov, who is retiring after seven years in the post. Tolmachov was chief designer of the Antonov An-124 freighter.</p>
<p>--Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
